  qa_defi_040_a: 'A common collateral pool used to secure multiple markets or products within a protocol.',

  qa_defi_041_q: 'What is a circuit breaker in DeFi?',
  qa_defi_041_a: 'An emergency pause mechanism that temporarily blocks operations when anomalies are detected.',

