  qa_nft_502_q: 'What does ERC-721 mean?',
  qa_nft_502_a: 'An NFT standard for unique tokens with a single owner of each token.',

  qa_nft_503_q: 'What is ERC-1155?',
  qa_nft_503_a: 'A hybrid standard that supports both unique and fungible tokens within a single contract.',

  qa_nft_504_q: 'What does NFT "metadata" mean?',
  qa_nft_504_a: 'The description of an NFT (image, name, attributes) stored on-chain or off-chain.',

  qa_nft_505_q: 'What is on-chain metadata?',
  qa_nft_505_a: 'Metadata fully recorded on the blockchain, without reliance on external servers.',

  qa_nft_506_q: 'What does IPFS mean for NFTs?',
  qa_nft_506_a: 'A decentralized storage system for files referenced by NFTs.',

