  qa_dao_801_q: 'What is a DAO?',
  qa_dao_801_a: 'A Decentralized Autonomous Organization where decisions are made by on-chain voting of participants.',

  qa_dao_802_q: 'What does "one token — one vote" mean?',
  qa_dao_802_a: 'A model where a participant’s influence is proportional to the number of tokens they hold.',

  qa_dao_803_q: 'What is quadratic voting?',
  qa_dao_803_a: 'A voting system where each additional vote costs more, reducing whale dominance.',

  qa_dao_804_q: 'What does delegation of votes mean?',
  qa_dao_804_a: 'Transferring your voting power to a trusted representative.',

  qa_dao_805_q: 'What is rage quit?',
  qa_dao_805_a: 'A mechanism to exit a DAO with redemption of your share of the treasury if you disagree with decisions.',

  qa_dao_806_q: 'What does dynamic quorum mean?',
  qa_dao_806_a: 'A voting threshold that changes depending on the importance of the proposal.',

  qa_dao_807_q: 'What is metagovernance?',
  qa_dao_807_a: 'Governing other protocols by holding their governance tokens.',

  qa_dao_808_q: 'What does subDAO mean?',
  qa_dao_808_a: 'A sub-division of a DAO for specific areas: marketing, listings, grants.',

  qa_dao_809_q: 'What is treasury streaming?',
  qa_dao_809_a: 'Distributing funds over time as a stream instead of a lump-sum payment.',

  qa_dao_810_q: 'What does reputation-based voting mean?',
  qa_dao_810_a: 'A model where voting power depends on contribution, not just token balance.',

  qa_dao_811_q: 'What is a governance attack?',
  qa_dao_811_a: 'Capturing control by buying up tokens or using flash loans.',

  qa_dao_812_q: 'What does transparent DAO treasury mean?',
  qa_dao_812_a: 'All DAO fund movements are visible on-chain and linked to decisions.',

  qa_dao_813_q: 'What is a DAO constitution?',
  qa_dao_813_a: 'A set of core principles and rules that are hard or impossible to change.',

  qa_dao_814_q: 'What does community council mean?',
  qa_dao_814_a: 'A group of elected members for operational decisions and moderation.',

  qa_dao_815_q: 'What is a grants DAO?',
  qa_dao_815_a: 'A mechanism for allocating funds to grow the ecosystem and projects.',

  qa_dao_816_q: 'What do D2D (DAO-to-DAO) alliances mean?',
  qa_dao_816_a: 'Cooperation and joint decisions between multiple DAOs.',

  qa_dao_817_q: 'What is the "QL7 governance layer"?',
  qa_dao_817_a: 'The system for managing QL7 products and treasury with community participation.',

  qa_dao_818_q: 'What does user participation in QL7 governance mean?',
  qa_dao_818_a: 'The ability to propose, discuss, and vote on platform changes.',

  qa_dao_819_q: 'What is the "unified economic model of forum, DeFi, and GameFi"?',
  qa_dao_819_a: 'A shared tokenomics layer linking activity across different QL7 products.',

  qa_dao_820_q: 'What does using NFTs as access keys to QL7 sections mean?',
